Some definitions in this directory and in the driver's tests in
kernel/tests/graphics are re-declared from NVIDIA's open GPU kernel modules at
release 535.183.01 (https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules), and
each file holding one says so in its first line. Below are the files of the
open kernel modules they come from, what each gives, and its copyright line.

